    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Autocomplete branch\nFor each split query, the Autocomplete node sends a GET request to a suggest/autocomplete endpoint and fetches related search phrases. Flatten Suggestions then converts the raw autocomplete response into a simple list of keyword items and passes them back through the loop so all query batches can be collected together.",
        "height": 352,
